Zafe app
========

Portions of this app are derived from Vizor (https://github.com/chainapsis/vizor-wallet),
Copyright the Vizor authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Derived files (lib/src/core/theme, lib/src/core/layout, lib/src/core/widgets,
lib/src/core/feedback, lib/src/core/formatting, lib/src/core/motion,
lib/src/core/privacy/privacy_mask.dart, lib/src/services/native_modal_corners.dart,
assets/icons; resynced with upstream commit 4bff2e7) were
modified for Zafe: imports made relative, platform channel names renamed to xyz.zafe/*,
account/avatar widgets removed, AppButton wrapped in button semantics, the transaction
progress screen's background image replaced by an optional background widget, and
Zafe-specific screens built on top. Vizor's name,
wordmark and illustrations are not included.

The illustrations in assets/illustrations are original Zafe work, generated by
scripts/illustrations in the Zafe repository.

Zafe restyles the derived code with its own palette, typefaces and shapes.

Fonts in assets/fonts (Space Grotesk, DM Sans, JetBrains Mono) are licensed under the SIL
Open Font License 1.1; see assets/fonts/licenses.
